# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dev / data-build artifacts at the project root.
# These are SOURCES used to build data/empires.json + data/cities.json,
# not runtime files. Excluded from the repo to keep clone + deploy fast.
# Keep them locally if you'll re-run the data build; copy off-machine if
# you want them under version control elsewhere.
# (Audit outputs cited by the reports are tracked under docs/reports/outputs/.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/world_*.geojson
/world_*.json
/places.geojson
/fix_*.json
/backups/

